    <node id="complaint_59">
      <data key="d0">complaint</data>
      <data key="d1">Entire road has been dug up, First for laying a trunk sewerage pipe line, then for laying underground power line. Since then road has neither been relaid nor repaired. Pot holes are galore in the entire road. It is difficult even to walk on the road.</data>
      <data key="d2">Long Term Solution</data>
      <data key="d3">12.9091108</data>
      <data key="d4">77.5152219</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ward_Rajarajeshwari Nagar (160)">
      <data key="d0">ward</data>
      <data key="d5">Rajarajeshwari Nagar (160)</data>
    </node>
    <node id="complaint_123">
      <data key="d0">complaint</data>
      <data key="d1">A year back, some sanitary work had been took place. But till now no one turned up to fix it.entire road have become sooo worse with lakhs of pebbles and stones. No one is able to use their vehicles fearing of a skid and accidents... please make sure it</data>
      <data key="d2">Rejected</data>
      <data key="d3">12.9312391</data>
      <data key="d4">77.5227545</data>
    </node>
    <node id="complaint_262">
      <data key="d0">complaint</data>
      <data key="d1">Roads are crooked with pot holes around. All the rain water from surrounding roads flows to our road and gets clogged in front of our house.</data>
      <data key="d2">Rejected</data>
      <data key="d3">12.9145188</data>
      <data key="d4">77.5202303</data>
    </node>
